Bundled components
------------------
The executable is statically linked. The MIT notice above applies to ktop;
it does not replace the copyright and license terms of bundled components.
The package includes their full notices under /usr/share/doc/ktop/licenses:

  LICENSE-ktop
    Unmodified upstream application MIT license.

  libc/LICENSE-MIT
  libc/LICENSE-APACHE
    Full copyright and license notices from the locked Rust libc crate
    (MIT OR Apache-2.0).

  rust/COPYRIGHT-library.html.gz
    Full Rust standard-library copyright and license notices, including its
    bundled third-party notices. Read with gzip -dc or zcat.

  rust/COPYRIGHT-distribution.html.gz
    Full matching Rust distribution copyright and license notices, including
    the musl C runtime objects bundled by the Rust musl target. Read with
    gzip -dc or zcat.

  rust/TOOLCHAIN
    Compiler version identifying the Rust distribution used for the build.

These full notices are supplied with the canonical standalone release binary;
packaging preserves the executable and notice contents without rebuilding.
